REVISION HISTORY

2026-08-05 — Contradiction resolved. The previous version of this file listed
all of `deposit/` under CC BY 4.0 in one clause and
`deposit/jira-caches-v1.tar.gz` under "NOT COVERED BY EITHER" in another, so the
archive was placed in two mutually exclusive buckets. `deposit/zenodo.json`
stated a third position: CC BY 4.0 over "this compilation and its manifest, not
the underlying Apache issue content". Heading 3 above adopts the `zenodo.json`
position, which is the defensible one, and the `deposit/` entry under heading 2
is narrowed to the manifests and prose. Reported in `audit/HYGIENE.md` §3.1 and
`paper/REVISION_LOG.md`. This was corrected in place rather than appended
because a licence that says two incompatible things is not a record of a past
belief — it is unusable, and the archive is queued for a Zenodo deposit whose
licence field cannot be edited after minting.

2026-08-05 — Attribution added. The Public Jira Dataset's three authors and its
CC BY 4.0 licence are now named (heading 4); the previous version said only that
it "carries its own licence". RefactoringMiner's copyright holder is now named.
